{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9872c86176b9e029d16067e50e48b4689c8103a8dc907d721cde4797008d6ef0",
      "text": "…确实，初见就能通关的游戏\n屈指可数呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfbf63b03ba2017eb21645f0f4574ffa3aaaf532fa747f0b1c7e4db0660bff3c",
      "text": "如果是对战形式的话，也会在意对手的发挥呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:338cf13fcce563e6a11788423cb2c65ba0c384e937ca78a6d9903422ea4971ef",
      "text": "难得跟朋友一起玩，\n还是能开开心心玩到最后的比较好啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ac322961ad0264ddb8a07fb9601a236d902201ea600732c309a3be89fe1068c",
      "text": "…嗯。而且在实际体验过游戏后，\n我还意识到了一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02b314af4561c5283b1d393efe173c894ccbeace70f5985134d25e9515d7af9e",
      "text": "…陈列在那里的每一款音乐游戏，\n在玩法和呈现方式上都有独一无二的特色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3abac1fa5c03e90419c65718e664f742fbaa941981d5d00d767b3bf54a45ec3f",
      "text": "…各自的个性，构成了它们的趣味所在。\n我们要宣传的游戏，其个性正是“合作游玩”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d0fc7f527d95b8778f714ec77777bbeab9911ab660073d87eb47b1a62da43c",
      "text": "正如老师说的那样啊。今天玩的这些里面，\n可没有通过合作来提高分数的音游呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53537a622b275b5074c477868943e69f09748965829a8978c0e432f19620f0f0",
      "text": "确实……！感觉重新体会到了\n我们要宣传的游戏的魅力所在呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1101bd5e4cec5091d761f397f5fb3820f9e49bc74c8a47380ddbb7b4e8f19e8c",
      "text": "俺也学到了不少。\n越来越期待宣传视频的拍摄了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c71b2dfd721d1eb780656c78cbeb0bb1ccbabb291ef7c61cc3477a1cf32e6ad6",
      "text": "我也超级期待的！正因为音游多到\n让人不知道玩哪款才好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1a60773f44032a6d171e15bdae337c5911c52dfacc9cc4349838ae1580e5699",
      "text": "才更要向大家传达出那款游戏独有的魅力。\n那样一来，露出笑容的人肯定也会变多吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af4c3cff440821587a33ac693b82bdffe44170267c3050d4e833e70ab34ed46d",
      "text": "…嗯，正如你所说。我们要全力以赴，\n把“合作游玩”的魅力传递给每一个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
